00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:01.829
OK.

00:00:01.829 --> 00:00:03.730
Another fact check that I want to do.

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:09.349
This is a really good opportunity to talk
about this new talking point that is spreading

00:00:09.349 --> 00:00:12.200
that only 9000 Americans died of corona virus.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.930
Now, you might hear that and say we hope nine
thousand one hundred and eighty something

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.190
thousand is the official death toll.

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:21.340
Where on earth are you getting that?

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.990
I'm going to tell you exactly where it comes
from.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:31.000
And in fact, Donald Trump tried amplifying
this talking point and retweeted a tweet that

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.269
Twitter removed because it was spreading disinformation
about Corona Virus 19.

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:40.969
So the original tweet was posted by a user
with the username.

00:00:40.969 --> 00:00:46.469
Little Mel has been removed and it now says
this tweet is no longer available because

00:00:46.469 --> 00:00:48.629
it violated the Twitter rules.

00:00:48.629 --> 00:00:55.929
The story that that tweet which Donald Trump
retweeted told, is one that alleges that new

00:00:55.929 --> 00:01:04.250
CDC data proves Corona virus was only the
cause of death in six percent of the deaths

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:12.170
so far, and that for all other Corona virus
deaths, the real cause of death was one, two

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:15.729
or even three other conditions or causes.

00:01:15.729 --> 00:01:21.490
And what a lot of right wingers are seizing
on is that six percent number and saying,

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:26.649
look, only 9000 people really died of corona
virus.

00:01:26.649 --> 00:01:29.009
Now, that tweet was removed.

00:01:29.009 --> 00:01:34.619
Donald Trump also retweeted a post by one
of his attorneys, Jenna Ellis, with a link

00:01:34.619 --> 00:01:38.229
to a story on a far right conspiracy Web site.

00:01:38.229 --> 00:01:44.570
Also based on the same Corona virus, 19 conspiracy
that read tweet hasn't been removed.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:52.570
And it says if you're looking very dramatically
shock, report that the CDC quietly updated

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:54.540
Cauvin numbers.

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:59.460
Only ninety two hundred died from Corona virus
alone.

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:02.280
The rest had different other serious illnesses.

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:06.670
Now, I'm going to explain the talking point
to you.

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:12.371
But I actually wonder, do you think Trump
believes only 9000 people really died of Corona

00:02:12.371 --> 00:02:16.730
virus, or do you think he's retweeting this
stuff because he knows that there's a political

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:18.090
advantage to doing it?

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:23.830
I actually am unsure, but it boggles the mind
how anyone could look at the data and say,

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:27.290
oh, these people didn't really die of corona
virus.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:30.730
So let me give you an analogy to what they
are saying.

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:36.590
This would be like saying most gunshot victims
don't die of a gunshot.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.370
They die of bleeding out.

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:41.739
And so gun shots aren't really that deadly.

00:02:41.739 --> 00:02:46.110
But listen, if you're going to bleed out,
that's a completely different story.

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:48.550
That's essentially the argument that they
are making.

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:55.680
What they are trying to say is the 94 percent
of corona virus deaths that had an additional

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.930
comorbidity weren't really corona virus deaths.

00:02:58.930 --> 00:03:05.660
And of course, this misses the point that
the way lots of people end up dying from communicable

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:12.379
disease is because they have an underlying
compromised immune system or they have another

00:03:12.379 --> 00:03:16.750
condition that makes the virus or whatever
disease we're talking about more dangerous

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.190
or deadly.

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:23.409
And the idea they're trying to spread is if
you're healthy, you don't really have anything

00:03:23.409 --> 00:03:24.849
to worry about.

00:03:24.849 --> 00:03:28.019
And therefore, we don't need to be doing all
the social distancing.

00:03:28.019 --> 00:03:29.019
We don't need masks.

00:03:29.019 --> 00:03:30.019
We don't need shutdowns.

00:03:30.019 --> 00:03:31.019
We don't need any of this stuff.

00:03:31.019 --> 00:03:33.269
Now, there's a couple different reactions
to this.

00:03:33.269 --> 00:03:38.750
First of all, 40 percent of Americans are
obese and obesity is an aggravating factor

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:39.860
for a corona virus.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:46.239
So if you want to make it to make the case
that if you have no comorbidity, you're really,

00:03:46.239 --> 00:03:48.180
really safe.

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:51.800
Forty percent of Americans have a major comorbidity
with which is obesity.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:57.459
So even if this was accurate in some way,
in some fundamental sense, it doesn't seem

00:03:57.459 --> 00:03:59.610
like this gets a lot of people off the hook.

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:01.180
That's number one.

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:02.910
Number two.

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:10.280
This is something that, if it were to become
widely believed, would be very dangerous because

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:15.909
it would simply encourage dangerous behavior,
including from people who do have comorbidities.

00:04:15.909 --> 00:04:20.930
A lot of people don't even understand the
concept of a co morbidity and risk factors

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:22.530
and aggravating factors.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:27.370
So this would be the type of stuff that Twitter
should be policing in general, but not that

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:31.330
what you would expect to see posted by a president
of the United States.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:34.009
But it is indeed being posted by the president
of the United States.

00:04:34.009 --> 00:04:38.530
And Twitter is regularly having to actually
deal with Donald Trump's tweets.

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:43.580
Another retreat from Trump was recently removed
for falsely claiming that there was a cure

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.210
for Corona virus.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:50.370
Twitter moderators have also had to deal with
Donald Trump's tweets that were glorifying

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.370
violence.

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:55.280
The reality is Donald Trump, if he were not
president, likely would have been banned from

00:04:55.280 --> 00:04:56.900
Twitter a long time ago.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:01.270
And yet they continue to insist that Twitter's
bias is actually an anti conservative more

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:03.660
than it is an anti liberal.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:04.930
Very, very weird stuff.

